{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSTabBarV","symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSTabBar","roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Tab bar is a system navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because today the OUDS tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"background color of tab bar can be changed for iOS lower than 26","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"background color of tab bar does not change since iOS 26","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"normal \/ unselected tab item color can be changed for both image and text only for iOS lower than 26"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"with iOS 26 no token of color are applied on unselected \/ normal tab item because only the image will be changed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and not the text making theme not readable in dark color scheme"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition the badges colors will be the same and cannot be changed (except with token definition). These particular badges do not rely on "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount"},{"type":"text","text":", the native API is used instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because Liquid Glass is available since iOS 26, the tab bar will be liquified \/ glassified since this OS version, not before."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if an app is built with Xcode 26 and the flag "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":" set to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES"}]},{"type":"text","text":", then Liquid Glass won’t be applied but the alternative layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nevertheless with Xcode 27 and for iOS 27, Liquid Glass will be always applied, whatever the value of the flag is."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use SF Symbols for images, if they exist their ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"fill"}]},{"text":" variant will be automatically used in the tab bar (native behaviour).","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Platform-considerations","type":"heading","text":"Platform considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This component is tailored for iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iPadOS the tabs do not apply the fonts since iPadOS 18","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because macOS does not support UIKit and because UIKIt is used to define the style of the tab bar, there is no styling of the tab bar for macOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS with its specific UI does not apply colors on tab bars and things are glasssified","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for tvOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Guidelines","text":"Guidelines"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS guidelines recommends to:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"limit when possible the number of items to 5","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"use both images and texts in tab bar items","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use badges only when needed to avoid to have heavy tab bar"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"be sure the selected information is not only defined by the color of the tab; you may need to change the shape or the fill of the image"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if a badge must be displayed, prefer short texts. If the text is a decimal value greater than 99, prefer display “+99”"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if decorative images are used for tab bar item, apply "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"template"}]},{"text":" rendering mode on it to apply color on tabs","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your tabs embedded in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" do not contain texts but only images, add an accessibility label introducing the journey for this tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If your tabs embedded in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" display a badge (empty or with text), vocalize it in your tab to let users know what it is (unread messages, new things, etc)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by using an accessibility value.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    OUDSTabBar {","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Emails\") \/\/ The text is vocalized first","                        .accessibilityValue(\"5 unread emails\") \/\/ A value vocalized after the text","            } icon: {","                Image(systemName: \"mail\").accessibilityHidden(true)","            }","        }","        .badge(5) \/\/ The value you give to the badge","    }",""]},{"text":"Selection of tabs","type":"heading","anchor":"Selection-of-tabs","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS lower than 26, a selected tab indicator is displayed in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" ; the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter must be defined (to the number of tabs in the component),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selectedTab"},{"type":"text","text":" binding value is equal to a given tag associated to a tab item."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise the indicator won’t appear; these parameters are mandatory to compute the location of the indicator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This rule is only applied if selected tab indicator must be displayed."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When the user taps a tab, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"selectedTab","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" binding is updated automatically, keeping the parent view in sync.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Technical-considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Technical considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to improve the Developer eXperience the current "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation lets users define their own tab items."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OUDS applies only appearances and styles on elements to prevent users to define raw data to assign to the component before being rendered like a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"picker"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus users will need to add their own accessiiblity label if badges are used or also apply "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"template","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering mode on images if needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus it will be also possible to use Liquid Glass new API with animations and items stacking."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must use in your tab bar items images with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a size of 26 x 26","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", otherwise rendering could be unaligned with Figma specifications","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the component cannot compute the ideal width of the selected tab indicator (for iOS before 26 and iPadOS before 18), ideal width based on the tab bar item content,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this indicator is not displayed for iOS lower than 26 in landscape mode and iPadOS."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app uses several universes with nested views, containing their own navigation and tab bars, prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hideTabBar()"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" to hide the tab bar"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TabView"},{"type":"text","text":" and overlay items) with Liquid Glass is disabled or not available, or also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tabBar(isHidden:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Use the OUDS tab bar to wrap tab bar items and associated views","    \/\/ Item tagged 0 will be selected first, 3 tabs are embedded.","    \/\/ Image with size of 26 x 26","    @State private var selectedTab = 0","","    OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: $selectedTab, count: 3) {","","        \/\/ Add the views with the SwiftUI tab item and labels","        \/\/ No need to define colors, everything is done inside OUDSTabBar","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 1\", image: \"image_1\")","            }","            .tag(0) \/\/ Must match the selectedTab binding value","        OtherView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Label 2\")","                } icon: {","                    Image(decorative: \"image_2\")","                        .renderingMode(.template) \/\/ Mandatory to apply color on selected item","                }","             }","            .tag(1) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","        LastView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 3\", image: \"image_3\")","            }","            .tag(2) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","    }"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Alternative components","level":2,"anchor":"Alternative-components"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to use SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tab"},{"text":" View with or without rules, use instead ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabView"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If you target apps with Liquid Glass enabled and need ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tab"},{"text":" or rules, use instead ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLiquidGlassTabView"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"type":"heading","text":"Liquid Glass","level":3,"anchor":"Liquid-Glass"},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":4,"anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","level":4,"anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":4,"anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark"}]},{"text":"Without Liquid Glass","anchor":"Without-Liquid-Glass","type":"heading","level":3},{"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark"}]},{"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(content:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selectedTab:count:content:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/body"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light":{"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light"},"component_tabBar_Sosh_light":{"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light"},"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light":{"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Wireframe_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light":{"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSBadgeCount":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbadgecount","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Badge is a UI element that emphasizes system notifications, status, or the categorization of an information, throughout colour only.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Badge is rendered as a coloured shape, without icon, text or number; and its chosen size remains unchanged regardless of the changes of the interface size.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" displays a text, as integer, limited to 99.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBadgeCount"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBadgeCount"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSBadgeCount"},"https://r.orange.fr/r/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unified-design-system.orange.com"}],"url":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","title":"unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark","type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSBadgeStandard":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Badge is a UI element that emphasizes system notifications, status, or the categorization of an information, throughout colour only.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Badge is rendered as a coloured shape, without icon, text or number; and its chosen size remains unchanged regardless of the changes of the interface size.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard"},{"text":" displays only a colored pastille.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbadgestandard","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","title":"OUDSBadgeStandard","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBadgeStandard"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBadgeStandard"}]},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark":{"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSTabBar","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","abstract":[{"text":"The Tab bar is a system navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar","role":"symbol"},"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark":{"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar/init(selectedTab:count:content:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines the tab bar component with given tab bar items and a two-way binding to the selected tab index."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Number of tabs and selected tab are needed to compute the selected tab indicator for iOS lower than 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you target iOS 26+ or other platform, prefer instead "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar(content:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"selectedTab","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt8","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5UInt8V"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSTabBarV7Contentxmfp"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selectedTab:count:content:)","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/init(selectedtab:count:content:)","kind":"symbol","title":"init(selectedTab:count:content:)","role":"symbol"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark":{"alt":"A tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark.png","traits":["1x","l